OL,3,CKey road to reopen in September
OL,4,Cfollowing repeated work delays
OL,6,FA date has been set for the long
OL,7,Fawaited reopening of a key Oxford city
OL,8,Fcentre route which has been closed for
OL,9,Fmore than three years.
OL,11,FTraffic will be able to use Botley
OL,12,FRoad from Sunday, September 20,
OL,13,FNetwork Rail has confirmed.
OL,15,FThe route was due to be operational
OL,16,Fagain at the end of August, but
OL,17,Frepeated gas leaks forced operators to
OL,18,Fdelay its reopening.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
