OL,3,CKey road to reopen in September
OL,4,Cfollowing repeated work delays
OL,6,FBotley Road has been shut since April
OL,7,F2023 as part of a #200 million project
OL,8,Fto upgrade Oxford Station.
OL,10,FTim Walden, Network Rail Great Western
OL,11,FRoute's Capital Delivery Director,
OL,12,Fsaid: "We know the continued closure
OL,13,Fof Botley Road has had a significant
OL,14,Fimpact on residents, businesses and
OL,15,Feveryone who relies on this route, and
OL,16,FI'd like to apologise again for the
OL,17,Fadditional disruption this has caused.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
