OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785401295
OL,3,CKey road to reopen in September
OL,4,Cfollowing repeated work delays
OL,6,F"While there is still important work
OL,7,Fto complete, we now have a clear
OL,8,Ftarget for reopening the road and our
OL,9,Fteams remain focused on delivering the
OL,10,Fremaining programme safely and
OL,11,Freopening Botley Road as soon as
OL,12,Fpossible."
